> what would be a lojban word for photon actually?
> gusyka'u? 
> 

Just "guska'u" (no "y"):

guska'u lujvo$guska'u$
x1 is a photon.
From: gusni, kantu. Cf. lektoni.
gusni (illumine) + kantu (quantum)

>From the 6th edition (200909) of Lojban-English dictionary.  Very nice work!

